  "summary": "PathAgentBench introduces a benchmark for evaluating evidence-seeking vision-language models (VLMs) across four complementary capabilities, while cross-model analysis highlights distinct representations and performance differences between VMamba and MambaOut. Both studies emphasize addressing bias and uncertainty in vision model decision-making.",
